1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,040
You can teleport anywhere on Earth.

2
00:00:02,621 --> 00:00:04,341
So you jump from Los Angeles

3
00:00:04,441 --> 00:00:04,961
to London...

4
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:07,602
and slam sideways into a wall.

5
00:00:08,162 --> 00:00:08,982
Earth spins.

6
00:00:09,702 --> 00:00:11,423
LA moves at about fourteen hundred

7
00:00:11,463 --> 00:00:12,383
kilometres an hour.

8
00:00:12,883 --> 00:00:14,063
London moves slower...

9
00:00:14,543 --> 00:00:15,664
in a different direction.

10
00:00:16,144 --> 00:00:18,564
You arrive still carrying LA's speed.

11
00:00:18,964 --> 00:00:21,085
Over two thousand kilometres an hour,

12
00:00:21,505 --> 00:00:22,105
sideways.

13
00:00:22,525 --> 00:00:24,326
And appearing where air already is

14
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:26,526
shoves it aside with a thunderclap.

15
00:00:27,006 --> 00:00:28,567
Try the top of Everest instead?

16
00:00:28,907 --> 00:00:30,367
The air is so thin you'd

17
00:00:30,427 --> 00:00:31,907
pass out in about two minutes.

18
00:00:32,348 --> 00:00:34,108
The only safe jumps are short

19
00:00:34,208 --> 00:00:34,388
ones.

20
00:00:34,948 --> 00:00:36,368
So you grab your coffee in

21
00:00:36,509 --> 00:00:36,789
LA...

22
00:00:37,129 --> 00:00:38,329
and teleport to London.

